WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,420
Saikawa doesn't want it. Let them go.

2
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:07,020
Cui Jichuan was his former teammate

3
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:09,020
Save him no matter what

4
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:11,020
He saved my enemy

5
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,060
Do you think I should let him go?

6
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,060
The reason why

7
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,700
I've already appreciated how scary he is

8
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,260
He also understood Sasikawa’s hatred towards him

9
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,460
Maybe we really did something wrong

10
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:20,460
Sasikawa has never actively attacked us from the beginning.

11
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:23,610
If you can let Matsikawa go

12
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:28,400
I am willing to join the stronghold

13
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,400
Sasikawa is the one who saved me

14
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,430
He also saved many people

15
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:34,530
Zombies are saving people

16
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:36,530
But the captain is indeed standing in front of me alive

17
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:42,340
I want to take the opportunity to activate my superpower

18
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:48,020
Take the captain back with you for resources

19
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:49,020
Go back

20
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:50,180
Living well here

21
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:52,660
don't bother me anymore

22
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:53,660
You go
